OL,3,AEight men arrested days after early
OL,4,Arelease from jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight men have been arrested by Greater
OL,7,FManchester Police days after leaving
OL,8,Fprison under the government's early
OL,9,Frelease scheme.
OL,11,FAbout 700 prisoners from across the
OL,12,Fcountry were released early on 1
OL,13,FOctober in a bid to tackle
OL,14,Fovercrowding, with about 50 of them
OL,15,Fbeing from Greater Manchester.
OL,17,FGMP confirmed that five men had been
OL,18,Farrested for breaches of criminal
OL,19,Forders, including a domestic abuse
OL,20,Fprevention order, and others were held
OL,21,Fon suspicion of robbery, drug offences
OL,22,Fand domestic violence.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
